{"title":"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Converting_to_Decimal_Form)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Converting to Decimal Form)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Common_Denominator)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Common Denominator)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/195cd337243e9eec2a1c55b3dc782d1f35dcc868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{1000} + \\frac{7}{100} + \\frac{8}{10} + \\frac{9}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"175\" height=\"38\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/8/5d8e07334e661d0b865b0405abb1e9c96d80e4c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0.6789 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0.9876 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 6.789 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 9.876$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"423\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Converting_to_Decimal_Form.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Converting_to_Decimal_Form)\">Solution 1 (Converting to Decimal Form)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Converting to Decimal Form)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/a/d0ae571b4880c7c4ad2987b87b4c44e3d10ba41b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{1000} + \\frac{7}{100} + \\frac{8}{10} + \\frac{9}{1} = 0.006 + 0.070 + 0.800 + 9.000 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 9.876}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"545\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Answer_Choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Answer_Choices)\">Solution 2 (Answer Choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Answer Choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can notice that all of the numbers are positive and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/5/5c57cc4ce5cee48117726806bc3a0e6c438df7c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9}{1} = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" />. This means that the answer must be more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Of the answer choices, the only one that is more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/f/a5fe0c24db604846b631a80baa6c44860b209a5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 9.876}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"90\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Common_Denominator.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Common_Denominator)\">Solution 3 (Common Denominator)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Common Denominator)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40c6ee1705c0fa1be75de2096cf75f86a6ef81a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{1000} + \\frac{7}{100} + \\frac{8}{10} + \\frac{9}{1} = \\frac{6 \\times 1}{1000 \\times 1} + \\frac{7 \\times 10}{100 \\times 10} + \\frac{8 \\times 100}{10 \\times 100} + \\frac{9 \\times 1000}{1 \\times 1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"553\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fdac6db30a009fd195b100847b32006591b7ec01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{6}{1000} + \\frac{70}{1000} + \\frac{800}{1000} + \\frac{9000}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"249\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3dd48665dc70a03156f12b332e0cad02aa9d1db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{6 + 70 + 800 + 9000}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"183\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/f/9cf904507a26509d5c735bb7ba786c57f292f112.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{9876}{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/3/92348bb0bfe5c41e09d998e736a55eac6c454297.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } 9.876}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"110\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC\" title=\"2023 CLMC\">2023 CLMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Answer_Key\" title=\"2023 CLMC Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2023 CLMC Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CLMC_Problems/Pro