x Mathematical Competition\">Canada Lynx Mathematical Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018023534\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 99/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1379/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 84/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2741/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.263      1 Template:CLMC_box\n100.00%    7.263      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36251:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018023534 and revision id 281070. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}